OL,3,GNEWSADiversions in village for tree
OL,4,Afelling works
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers have been warned of daytime
OL,7,Fdisruption on part of a busy route to
OL,8,Fthe airport while tree felling takes
OL,9,Fplace.
OL,11,FA section of Main Road between higher
OL,12,Fand lower Foxdale will be closed
OL,13,Fbetween 09:00 BST and 16:00 until
OL,14,FThursday.
OL,16,FDiversions will be in place leading
OL,17,Ftraffic via Ballacraine on the A3 or
OL,18,Fthrough the Braaid to Glen Vine on the
OL,19,FA1 Peel Road.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
